title: Kerberos Encryption Downgrade to RC4
id: d20d0f0e-cb0e-4943-a065-88981532ca87
status: experimental
description: Detects Kerberos ticket requests negotiating RC4 (etype 23) in an environment that supports AES, an encryption-downgrade pattern associated with Kerberoasting and ticket-forgery activity.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/
logsource:
  category: network_connection
detection:
  selection:
    protocol: 'kerberos'
    encryption_type: '0x17'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - dst_port
falsepositives:
  - Legacy systems requiring RC4
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1558
